## Uncertainty Manifestation: Ambiguous Time Window for Scheduled Deliveries

**Description**:
The API function has been extended to support scheduled deliveries, but the documentation and implementation create significant ambiguity around how the delivery time window should be specified. Developers are uncertain whether the `delivery_time_window` parameter expects absolute timestamps, relative time offsets, or a duration range. This ambiguity leads to inconsistent implementations and delivery scheduling errors.

